@page "/process"

<Seo Title="How we work" Description="Our four-step process: discover, design, build and test, launch — with fixed prices and weekly demos." />

<section class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>How we <span class="x-grad">work</span></h1>
        <p class="lede">Clear steps, fixed prices and a demo every week. You always know what's happening and what it costs.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container"><ProcessSteps /></div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container x-faq-grid">
        <div class="x-head" style="margin:0">
            <h2>The details</h2>
            <p>What working with us looks like, whether you're starting fresh or fixing something.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="x-faq">
            <details class="glass" open>
                <summary>New websites and apps</summary>
                <p>We start with a call and a written proposal that splits the work into phases, each with its own fixed price. Nothing is built before you approve the design, and you get a working demo every week.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="glass">
                <summary>Fixing an existing website</summary>
                <p>Send us the link, the error and, if you have it, access to the code. We find the root cause, fix it and add an automated test so it can't quietly come back. You get a short written report.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="glass">
                <summary>Upgrades and redesigns</summary>
                <p>Outdated technology stops getting security updates. We modernise step by step behind automated tests, and plan the switch so your visitors never notice.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="glass">
                <summary>Payment and ownership</summary>
                <p>You pay per phase, by card or bank transfer. The design, the code and all accounts are yours from day one.</p>
            </details>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="x-cta spot">
            <h2>Ready when <span class="x-grad">you are.</span></h2>
            <p>Tell us about your project and get a plan and fixed price within 24 hours.</p>
            <div class="x-actions" style="justify-content:center"><a class="btn btn--glow btn--lg" href="/contact">Start your project</a></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
